#: man-kicker.1.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; was written by &Matthias.Elter; and &Matthias.Ettrich; and is "
"maintained by &Aaron.J.Seigo; &Aaron.J.Seigo.mail;"
msgstr ""
"kappname ត្រូវ​បានសរសេរ​ដោយ  &Matthias.Elter; និង &Matthias.Ettrich; "
"ហើយ​ត្រូវ​បានថែទាំ​ដោយ​ &Aaron.J.Seigo; &Aaron.J.Seigo.mail;"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kicker.1.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This man page was written for &kde; 3.4 by &Lauri.Watts; &Lauri.Watts.mail;"
msgstr ""
